WEBVTT

00:07:59.440 --> 00:08:01.816
Now, genes are really
important to all of this,

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:04.576
but critically, genes don't
determine anything,

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:08.240
because genes work differently
in different environments.

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:09.896
Key example here:

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:13.056
there's a variant of a gene called MAO-A,

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:14.736
and if you have that variant,

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:19.416
you are far more likely
to commit antisocial violence

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:23.416
if, and only if,
you were abused as a child.

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:25.816
Genes and environment interact,

00:08:25.840 --> 00:08:29.456
and what's happening in that one second
before you pull that trigger

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:33.720
reflects your lifetime
of those gene-environment interactions.